          "license": "CC BY-SA 3.0",
          "artist": "Yewenyi at English Wikipedia",
          "sourceUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pine_Creek_Rail_Steel_Sleepers_DSC03637.jpg",
